  message: "Tag cleanup (2026-04-17): removed `cross_language_linkers` tag. Per the 2026-04-16 discussion clarification above and ADR-0003-ext, this is a **Framework-subcategory** linker (Java/Kotlin/Scala internal framework dispatch via Jackson reflection). The cross-language consequence (serialized JSON is parsed by downstream TS/Python/Ruby clients) is downstream of the linker; the existing `openapi.py` / `http.py` already connect the boundary. Keeping `analysis_quality` tag."  # aeb0
